          \n            \n\n            \n                                                    \n    <div>\n\n                            <div data-nosnippet=\"\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                <a href=\"/author/chandra-steele/\">\n                                    <picture>\n                                        <source media=\"(max-width: 480px)\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=36&h=36\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=90&h=90\" alt=\"4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\">\n                                    </picture>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <div>\n                                                                                \n                                    \n                \n                                                                                                                                    <p><time datetime=\"2026-08-14T20:05:16Z\"><span>Published</span> Aug 14, 2026, 4:05 PM EDT</time>\n                        </p>\n                                    \n                                \n                \n            </div>\n                                            \n                                \n                                    <p>Chandra Steele has been writing about tech for the entirety of <a href=\"https://authory.com/ChandraSteele\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">her journalism career</a>. She loves making tough topics easy to understand. Before joining Android Police, Chandra was senior features writer at PCMag where she did everything from interviewing Jeff Goldblum to explaining crypto.&#160; </p>\n                            \n        </div>\n\n\n            <a id=\"login-button-article-sidebar\">\n            <p>Sign in to your <span>Android Police</span> account</p>\n            \n        </a>\n                \n                        \n            \n                                                            \n                                            \n                \n                \n                \n            \n            \n\n        \n                        \n        \n                                                                                            \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n                                                                        \n                                    \n        \n                                                \n                                                                                                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                    \n    \n    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                    \n\n\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n                                        <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! -->\n\n                \n<div itemprop=\"articleBody\" id=\"article-body\"><p>Those who are tired of having a tiny tag in the corner of what they’ve created with Gemini can now remove it. </p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><p>The latest version of Gemini, Gemini Spark, 3.7 Flash, lets users get rid of the visible watermarks that appear in the corners of images created with Nano Banana, videos made with Omni, and song lyrics generated with Lyria. </p>    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n            \n    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n                                        \n    \n        \n    \n        \n                \n        \n                        \n    \n<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"change-does-not-supersede-the-law\">\n                        Change does not supersede the law\n               </h2>\n<p>However, this does not work in countries where the watermarks are required by law, which China, South Korea, and countries in the EU. </p>    <p>Furthermore, removing the watermark does not remove the Invisible SynthID watermarks and C2PA metadata, which will remain embedded in the background. </p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"rolling-out-to-users\">\n                        Rolling out to users\n               </h2>\n<p>The ability to turn off watermarks is rolling out now and should be available to all within days. </p>    \n\n                \n<p>Watermarking is on by default in Gemini. To remove it, go to Settings &gt; Show watermark and toggle it on or or off. Whatever you select will apply to all future images, videos, and music tracks.</p>    </div>\n    \n    \n        \n                        \n                \n        \n        \n\n                    \n                        \n    \n\n\n            \n                                \n        \n        \n    \n\n        \n    </article>\n\n    \n            \n        </DIV></DIV>","content_text":"Credit: Lucas Gouveia / Android Police Published Aug 14, 2026, 4:05 PM EDT Chandra Steele has been writing about tech for the entirety of her journalism career. She loves making tough topics easy to understand. Before joining Android Police, Chandra was senior features writer at PCMag where she did everything from interviewing Jeff Goldblum to explaining crypto. Sign in to your Android Police account Those who are tired of having a tiny tag in the corner of what they’ve created with Gemini can now remove it. The latest version of Gemini, Gemini Spark, 3.7 Flash, lets users get rid of the visible watermarks that appear in the corners of images created with Nano Banana, videos made with Omni, and song lyrics generated with Lyria. Change does not supersede the law However, this does not work in countries where the watermarks are required by law, which China, South Korea, and countries in the EU. Furthermore, removing the watermark does not remove the Invisible SynthID watermarks and C2PA metadata, which will remain embedded in the background. Rolling out to users The ability to turn off watermarks is rolling out now and should be available to all within days. Watermarking is on by default in Gemini. To remove it, go to Settings > Show watermark and toggle it on or or off. Whatever you select will apply to all future images, videos, and music tracks.","fetched_at":"2026-08-15T22:06:16.526Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><time datetime=\"2026-08-14T20:05:16Z\"><span>Published</span> Aug 14, 2026, 4:05 PM EDT</time>\n                        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Published Aug 14, 2026, 4:05 PM EDT","zh":"发布于 2026 年 8 月 14 日下午 4:05（美国东部时间）"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Chandra Steele has been writing about tech for the entirety of <a href=\"https://authory.com/ChandraSteele\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">her journalism career</a>. She loves making tough topics easy to understand. Before joining Android Police, Chandra was senior features writer at PCMag where she did everything from interviewing Jeff Goldblum to explaining crypto.&#160; </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Chandra Steele has been writing about tech for the entirety of her journalism career.","zh":"钱德拉·斯蒂尔（Chandra Steele）在她的整个新闻职业生涯中一直在撰写有关科技的文章。"},{"en":"She loves making tough topics easy to understand.","zh":"她喜欢让困难的话题变得容易理解。"},{"en":"Before joining Android Police, Chandra was senior features writer at PCMag where she did everything from interviewing Jeff Goldblum to explaining crypto.","zh":"在加入 Android Police 之前，Chandra 是 PCMag 的高级专题撰稿人，她负责从采访 Jeff Goldblum 到解释加密货币等各种事务。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Sign in to your <span>Android Police</span> account</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sign in to your Android Police account","zh":"登录您的 Android Police 帐户"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Those who are tired of having a tiny tag in the corner of what they’ve created with Gemini can now remove it. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Those who are tired of having a tiny tag in the corner of what they’ve created with Gemini can now remove it.","zh":"那些厌倦了在使用 Gemini 创建的内容的角落里贴上小标签的人现在可以将其删除。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>The latest version of Gemini, Gemini Spark, 3.7 Flash, lets users get rid of the visible watermarks that appear in the corners of images created with Nano Banana, videos made with Omni, and song lyrics generated with Lyria. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The latest version of Gemini, Gemini Spark, 3.7 Flash, lets users get rid of the visible watermarks that appear in the corners of images created with Nano Banana, videos made with Omni, and song lyrics generated with Lyria.","zh":"Gemini 的最新版本 Gemini Spark 3.7 Flash 可以让用户去除出现在 Nano Banana 创建的图像、Omni 制作的视频以及 Lyria 生成的歌词角落中的可见水印。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"change-does-not-supersede-the-law\">\n                        Change does not supersede the law\n               </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Change does not supersede the law","zh":"改变并不取代法律"}]},{"html_en":"<p>However, this does not work in countries where the watermarks are required by law, which China, South Korea, and countries in the EU. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"However, this does not work in countries where the watermarks are required by law, which China, South Korea, and countries in the EU.","zh":"然而，这在法律要求水印的国家/地区不起作用，例如中国、韩国和欧盟国家。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Furthermore, removing the watermark does not remove the Invisible SynthID watermarks and C2PA metadata, which will remain embedded in the background. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Furthermore, removing the watermark does not remove the Invisible SynthID watermarks and C2PA metadata, which will remain embedded in the background.","zh":"此外，删除水印不会删除 Invisible SynthID 水印和 C2PA 元数据，它们将仍然嵌入在后台。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"rolling-out-to-users\">\n                        Rolling out to users\n               </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Rolling out to users","zh":"向用户推出"}]},{"html_en":"<p>The ability to turn off watermarks is rolling out now and should be available to all within days. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The ability to turn off watermarks is rolling out now and should be available to all within days.","zh":"关闭水印的功能现已推出，并且应该会在几天内向所有人开放。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Watermarking is on by default in Gemini. To remove it, go to Settings &gt; Show watermark and toggle it on or or off. Whatever you select will apply to all future images, videos, and music tracks.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Watermarking is on by default in Gemini.","zh":"Gemini 中默认启用水印。"},{"en":"To remove it, go to Settings > Show watermark and toggle it on or or off.","zh":"要删除它，请转到“设置”>“显示水印”，然后打开或关闭它。"},{"en":"Whatever you select will apply to all future images, videos, and music tracks.","zh":"您选择的任何内容都将应用于以后的所有图像、视频和音乐曲目。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n\n        \n                                        \n\n\n\n\n            <article>\n\n                            \n\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               