                                                \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                    \n    \n    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                    \n\n\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n                                        <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! -->\n\n                \n<div itemprop=\"articleBody\" id=\"article-body\"><p>那些厌倦了在使用 Gemini 创建的内容的角落里贴上小标签的人现在可以将其删除。</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><p>Gemini 的最新版本 Gemini Spark 3.7 Flash 可以让用户去除出现在 Nano Banana 创建的图像、Omni 制作的视频以及 Lyria 生成的歌词角落中的可见水印。</p>    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n            \n    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n                                        \n    \n        \n    \n        \n                \n        \n                        \n    \n<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"change-does-not-supersede-the-law\">改变并不取代法律</h2>\n<p>然而，这在法律要求水印的国家/地区不起作用，例如中国、韩国和欧盟国家。</p>    <p>此外，删除水印不会删除 Invisible SynthID 水印和 C2PA 元数据，它们将仍然嵌入在后台。</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"rolling-out-to-users\">向用户推出</h2>\n<p>关闭水印的功能现已推出，并且应该会在几天内向所有人开放。</p>    \n\n                \n<p>Gemini 中默认启用水印。 要删除它，请转到“设置”&gt;“显示水印”，然后打开或关闭它。 您选择的任何内容都将应用于以后的所有图像、视频和音乐曲目。</p>    </div>\n    \n    \n        \n                        \n                \n        \n        \n\n                    \n                        \n    \n\n\n            \n                                \n        \n        \n    \n\n        \n    </article>\n\n    \n            \n        </div></div>"}